App Drawer

This project is a modified hard fork of OmaBar Drawer:
https://github.com/amitcpatel/omabar-drawer

OmaBar Drawer was created by Amit Patel and derives portions of Omarchy's
bar, whose copyright is held by David Heinemeier Hansson. Their copyright
notices and the complete MIT license are preserved in LICENSE.

The hard-fork identity, architecture, service, settings, IPC, tests, and later
modifications are maintained by bolens. “App Drawer” and the
io.github.bolens.app-drawer identifier distinguish this fork from upstream.
